[statement]
Reduced from Alpine v3.24 (`main` and `community`, 2026-11-08), asked for
`lua-resty-dns`. `nginx-mod-http-lua` needs `nginx=1.30.6-r0` and
`nginx-mod-devel-kit`. `openresty-mod-devel-kit` provides
`nginx-mod-devel-kit` at a later version than the real package, but needs
`openresty`, which provides `nginx` at no version: the requirement on `nginx`
binds it, so `openresty` is ruled out, and with it `openresty-mod-devel-kit`.
The rules of `providers/a-requirement-binds-a-provider-at-no-version` and
`decision-order/a-candidate-needing-only-ruled-out-packages-is-passed-over`.
(`so:libz.so.1`, which nothing here provides, is kept from the reduction.)

